  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\(transitive)::relation:?on{X}]\nRefines: R\nwhen: X is \\set\nsatisfies:\n. forAll: x, y, z \"in\" X\n  where:\n  . R(x, y)\n  . R(y, z)\n  then: R(x, z)\nDocumented:\n. adjective: \"transitive\"\n. description: \"A relation $R$ on $X$ is transitive if $x \\mathrel{R} y$ and\n                $y \\mathrel{R} z$ imply $x \\mathrel{R} z$.\"\nId: \"8baba6bf-25f4-48b4-84f9-4b2db59ccf47\"",
